# codes: P1406 P1406
file "sffm.sp" deck
  title "sffm"
  comment " oracle: vsrcload.c SFFM (VO VA FM MDI FC TD PHM PHC; 0 for t - TD <= 0); isrcload.c SFFM (no delay; 6th value PHM, 7th PHC); R36 (dc is the wave at t = 0); runs: V op 0 for td 0, 0.5 for td -1m; I `sffm(0.5 1 1k 2 10k 30)` op -1.34147 into 1 ohm"
  element vsource V1 (a 0) wave=sffm(offset=0.5 amplitude=1 carrier_freq=10k mod_index=2 signal_freq=1k law=ngspice pre=zero given_zero=spice_default) dc_rule=wave_at_zero
  element vsource V2 (b 0) wave=sffm(offset=0.5 amplitude=1 carrier_freq=10k mod_index=2 signal_freq=1k delay=-1m law=ngspice pre=zero given_zero=spice_default) dc_rule=wave_at_zero
  element isource I3 (c 0) wave=sffm(offset=0.5 amplitude=1 carrier_freq=10k mod_index=2 signal_freq=1k phase_m_deg=30 law=ngspice pre=hold_delay_value given_zero=spice_default) dc_rule=wave_at_zero
  element resistor R3 (c 0) value=1
  element vsource V4 (d 0) wave=sffm(offset=0 amplitude=1 law=ngspice pre=zero given_zero=spice_default) dc_rule=wave_at_zero
  analysis op
  opaque ngspice inert ".control\nprint v(a) v(b) v(c) v(d)\n.endc"
  analysis tran stop=100u print_step=1u cap=ngspice_rule
  opaque ngspice inert ".control\nprint v(a)[30] v(b)[30] v(c)[30]\n.endc"
